Berkeley SoftFloat 3e, unmodified arithmetic sources, 8086 specialization.
Source: https://www.jhauser.us/arithmetic/SoftFloat-3e.zip
Archive SHA256: 21130ce885d35c1fe73fc1e1bf2244178167e05c6747cad5f450cc991714c746
COPYING.txt contains the upstream license and required notices.
PCE supplies platform.h. This initial subset supports extF80_add only.
Build currently requires GCC/Clang with unsigned __int128 and byte-order macros.
No hardware x87 or host floating point is used. Expand portability before release.
